      recs: 'Accept your life motto: “a feeling of freedom and creative inspiration in everything”. Work through where inside you are not yet free. Answer the question: where do I feel constrained and tight? Work through the fear of going into the new and unknown, of starting from zero. Work through attachments to anything in life. Learn to let go and give freedom not only to yourself but to others too. Help those still weak in spirit to loosen up and free themselves. Be an example to others of optimism, cheerfulness, joy, lightness and freedom. Work through the fear of unfreedom and closed spaces. Believe in your abilities and success, live simply in joy and expect nothing in return. Open your heart to the whole world — the whole world is your home. Travel a lot, carry the philosophy of freedom and spirituality around the world.',
